.TH MYSTRNCPY 3
.SH NAME
mystrncpy \- copy up to n characters from a string
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrncpy(char *dest, const char *src, int n);
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B mystrncpy
copies up to
.I n
characters from
.I src
to
.I dest.
If the source string is shorter than
.I n,
the remaining destination positions are filled with null characters.
.PP
If
.I dest
or
.I src
is NULL, or
.I n
is negative, the function returns -1.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns 0 on success, or -1 for invalid input.
.SH AUTHOR
Usman Hassan <usmaanhassan@outlook.com>
